      "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "lazy_t", "x": 164, "y": 618, "width": 1372, "height": 95,
      "text": "The way out of Open is lazy, not timed\nThere is no timer. The state is still Open until a call arrives and finds that openDuration has elapsed  -  that\ncall is the one that moves it to HalfOpen and gets tried. A circuit with no traffic stays Open forever, and\nState reads Open right up until someone knocks. Reset() forces Closed from any state.",
      "originalText": "The way out of Open is lazy, not timed\nThere is no timer. The state is still Open until a call arrives and finds that openDuration has elapsed  -  that\ncall is the one that moves it to HalfOpen and gets tried. A circuit with no traffic stays Open forever, and\nState reads Open right up until someone knocks. Reset() forces Closed from any state.",
      "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 260039, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 260040, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "wire", "x": 1660, "y": 160, "width": 700, "height": 300,
      "strokeColor": "#dc2626", "backgroundColor": "#fee2e2", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 260041, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 260042, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "wire_t", "x": 1682, "y": 178, "width": 656, "height": 264,
      "text": "Nothing wires this for you\n\nAddAITaskAgent() reads the CircuitBreaker\nsection into AITaskAgentOptions and then\ndoes nothing with it. It does not register\nCircuitBreaker, and no middleware or step\never calls one.\n\nSetting FailureThreshold in appsettings\nchanges nothing on its own. The options\nexist so that you can construct the\nprimitive from them in your own\ncomposition root.\n\nDefaults if you pass nothing: threshold 5,\nopenDuration one minute.",
      "originalText": "Nothing wires this for you\n\nAddAITaskAgent() reads the CircuitBreaker\nsection into AITaskAgentOptions and then\ndoes nothing with it. It does not register\nCircuitBreaker, and no middleware or step\never calls one.\n\nSetting FailureThreshold in appsettings\nchanges nothing on its own. The options\nexist so that you can construct the\nprimitive from them in your own\ncomposition root.\n\nDefaults if you pass nothing: threshold 5,\nopenDuration one minute.",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#991b1b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 260043, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 260044, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "use", "x": 1660, "y": 490, "width": 700, "height": 240,
      "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#eff6ff", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 260045, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 260046, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "use_t", "x": 1682, "y": 508, "width": 656, "height": 204,
      "text": "Where it fits in this framework\n\nThe natural place is inside an ILlmService\ndecorator, turning a tripped circuit into\na retriable failure rather than an\nexception the step has to catch:\n\n  return LlmResult.Failure(\n      ex, isRetriable: true);\n\nThat keeps the result pattern intact, and\nlets the fallback chain move to another\nprovider instead of failing the run.",
      "originalText": "Where it fits in this framework\n\nThe natural place is inside an ILlmService\ndecorator, turning a tripped circuit into\na retriable failure rather than an\nexception the step has to catch:\n\n  return LlmResult.Failure(\n      ex, isRetriable: true);\n\nThat keeps the result pattern intact, and\nlets the fallback chain move to another\nprovider instead of failing the run.",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 260047, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 260048, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "text", "id": "foot", "x": 140, "y": 760, "width": 2220, "height": 19,
      "text": "RateLimiter is the same story: a standalone token bucket, configured but never wired. Verified against CircuitBreaker.cs and ServiceCollectionExtensions.cs.",
      "originalText": "RateLimiter is the same story: a standalone token bucket, configured but never wired. Verified against CircuitBreaker.cs and ServiceCollectionExtensions.cs.",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 260049, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 260050, "isDeleted": false,
